# Your rule content

---
description: general code style
globs: *.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Our python code should be typed, readable, maintainable, easy to test
- not overcomplicated, not needlessly abstracted, mostly functional, although we do like the strategy pattern. 
- don't edit files that are not explicitly references without permission
- to execute python code use uv package manager, e.g. `uv run python main.py` `uv run pytest .`